{% raw %}
A ONE-TIME LINK WAS GENERATED FOR THE REQUESTED ACTION

Hello, {{ .DisplayName }}!

We need to confirm the requested action related to your account security at {{ .Domain }}.

Do not share this notification or its contents with anyone.

If you initiated this request, open the confirmation link below.

{{ .LinkText }} {{ .LinkURL }}

Alternatively, copy and paste this URL into your browser address bar:

{{ .LinkURL }} {{ .LinkURL }}

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

If you did NOT initiate this request, your credentials may be compromised. You should:

 1. Revoke the confirmation link using the links below;
 2. Change your password or other login credentials;
 3. Contact your administrator.

{{ .RevocationLinkText }} {{ .RevocationLinkURL }}

To revoke the link, click the button above or copy and paste this URL into your browser address bar:

{{ .RevocationLinkURL }} {{ .RevocationLinkURL }}

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This message is intended for {{ .DisplayName }}. This event was generated by an action from IP address {{ .RemoteIP }}. If you are unsure whether your actions caused this event or are concerned about account security, follow the recommendations above.
{% endraw %}
